si when talking about the passage of this unbelievably unpopular piece of legislation said something chilling, but true. The wonderful feature, not bug of Nancy Pelosi, perhaps it's a bug, it depends on your perspective, is that she has so much plastic and so much, she's more machine than man now, she has so much like injected into her brain and so much clattering of the dentures that like she sometimes just vomits out like true things. She straight up says what's happening when she shouldn't. She'd be smart, smart enough to actually like have a more political answer. But Nancy Pelosi, she's been around for so long. She's such a fossil, much like Joe Biden. She's straight up like blurts it out. Joe Biden the other day at the White House saying, I've sold more state secrets than I can remember. Yeah, we get it, Joe. Nancy Pelosi saying, and you'll remember this word for word, we have to pass the bill. to find out what's inside of it. Go.",
